{"seq":3,"slug":"event-driven","title":"事件驱动架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/event-driven","wordCount":1187,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件驱动架构\">事件驱动架构</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>事件驱动架构（Event-Driven Architecture, EDA）是一种以事件的产生、检测和响应为核心的架构风格。在 EDA 中，系统组件通过发布和订阅事件来通信，而非直接的 RPC 调用。这种模式天然具备松耦合、高扩展性和异步处理的特点，是构建复杂分布式系统的有力武器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件驱动架构围绕&quot;事件&quot;这一载体重组了组件间的通信方式，四个概念是它的骨架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>事件 vs 请求</strong>：请求驱动直接依赖调用方（同步强一致），事件驱动通过事件总线解耦（最终一致、加订阅者无需改发布方）。</li>\n<li><strong>事件类型</strong>：领域事件（业务事实）、集成事件（跨限界上下文）、通知事件（只告知）、事件携带状态（含完整状态变更），选择决定了解耦程度。</li>\n<li><strong>事件溯源</strong>：把状态变更存为不可变的事件序列而非当前状态，天然获得完整历史与审计能力，代价是存储量增大、需快照优化。</li>\n<li><strong>CQRS 与 Outbox</strong>：CQRS 分离读写模型各自优化；Outbox 模式用&quot;同库事务内写事件表 + 独立 Relay 发布&quot;解决数据库更新与事件发布的原子性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主线：<strong>事件驱动用最终一致性换来了时间与空间上的解耦——它让发布方不必知道订阅者，代价是必须靠事件溯源、CQRS、Outbox 这些模式补齐一致性与可追溯性。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件驱动-vs-请求驱动\">事件驱动 vs 请求驱动</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph 请求驱动&#10;    A1[订单服务] --&gt;|同步调用| B1[库存服务]&#10;    A1 --&gt;|同步调用| C1[通知服务]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph 请求驱动\n    A1[订单服务] --&gt;|同步调用| B1[库存服务]\n    A1 --&gt;|同步调用| C1[通知服务]\n  end</pre><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph 事件驱动&#10;    A2[订单服务] --&gt;|发布事件| E[Event Bus]&#10;    E --&gt;|订阅| B2[库存服务]&#10;    E --&gt;|订阅| C2[通知服务]&#10;    E --&gt;|订阅| D2[积分服务]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph 事件驱动\n    A2[订单服务] --&gt;|发布事件| E[Event Bus]\n    E --&gt;|订阅| B2[库存服务]\n    E --&gt;|订阅| C2[通知服务]\n    E --&gt;|订阅| D2[积分服务]\n  end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>请求驱动</th>\n<th>事件驱动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>耦合度</td>\n<td>高（直接依赖）</td>\n<td>低（通过事件解耦）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>加新消费者需改调用方</td>\n<td>加新订阅者无需改发布方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>同步强一致</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可追溯</td>\n<td>调用链</td>\n<td>事件流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>需要事件基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件类型\">事件类型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>领域事件</td>\n<td>业务发生的重要事实</td>\n<td>OrderCreated</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成事件</td>\n<td>跨限界上下文的事件</td>\n<td>PaymentCompleted</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知事件</td>\n<td>只告知发生了什么</td>\n<td>UserLoggedIn</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件携带状态</td>\n<td>包含完整的状态变更信息</td>\n<td>OrderUpdated(全量数据)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"事件结构\">事件结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;eventId&quot;: &quot;evt-2024-001&quot;,&#10;  &quot;eventType&quot;: &quot;OrderCreated&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aggregateId&quot;: &quot;order-123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aggregateType&quot;: &quot;Order&quot;,&#10;  &quot;timestamp&quot;: &quot;2024-01-15T10:30:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: 1,&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;orderId&quot;: &quot;order-123&quot;,&#10;    &quot;userId&quot;: &quot;user-456&quot;,&#10;    &quot;items&quot;: [{ &quot;productId&quot;: &quot;p1&quot;, &quot;quantity&quot;: 2 }],&#10;    &quot;totalAmount&quot;: 199.0&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;metadata&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;correlationId&quot;: &quot;req-789&quot;,&#10;    &quot;causationId&quot;: &quot;cmd-012&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"eventId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"evt-2024-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"eventType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OrderCreated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aggregateId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aggregateType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"timestamp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"orderId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"userId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user-456\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"productId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"totalAmount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">199.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"metadata\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"correlationId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"req-789\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"causationId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cmd-012\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件溯源-event-sourcing\">事件溯源（Event Sourcing）</h2><p>事件溯源将实体的状态变更存储为不可变的事件序列，而非存储当前状态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  E1[&quot;OrderCreated&lt;br/&gt;(items, user)&quot;] --&gt; E2[&quot;ItemAdded&lt;br/&gt;(product, qty)&quot;]&#10;  E2 --&gt; E3[&quot;PaymentReceived&lt;br/&gt;(amount)&quot;]&#10;  E3 --&gt; E4[&quot;OrderShipped&lt;br/&gt;(tracking)&quot;]&#10;  E4 --&gt; S[&quot;当前状态&lt;br/&gt;(重放所有事件)&quot;]\">graph LR\n  E1[\"OrderCreated&lt;br/&gt;(items, user)\"] --&gt; E2[\"ItemAdded&lt;br/&gt;(product, qty)\"]\n  E2 --&gt; E3[\"PaymentReceived&lt;br/&gt;(amount)\"]\n  E3 --&gt; E4[\"OrderShipped&lt;br/&gt;(tracking)\"]\n  E4 --&gt; S[\"当前状态&lt;br/&gt;(重放所有事件)\"]</pre><h3 id=\"传统-crud-vs-事件溯源\">传统 CRUD vs 事件溯源</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>CRUD</th>\n<th>Event Sourcing</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>当前状态</td>\n<td>事件序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史</td>\n<td>丢失（除非额外记录）</td>\n<td>完整保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计</td>\n<td>需要额外实现</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试</td>\n<td>只能看到最终状态</td>\n<td>可以重放到任意时刻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储量</td>\n<td>较少</td>\n<td>较多（需要快照优化）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"快照优化\">快照优化</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  E1[Event 1] --&gt; E2[Event 2] --&gt; E3[...] --&gt; E100[Event 100]&#10;  E100 --&gt; SNAP[&quot;Snapshot @100&quot;]&#10;  SNAP --&gt; E101[Event 101] --&gt; E102[Event 102]\">graph LR\n  E1[Event 1] --&gt; E2[Event 2] --&gt; E3[...] --&gt; E100[Event 100]\n  E100 --&gt; SNAP[\"Snapshot @100\"]\n  SNAP --&gt; E101[Event 101] --&gt; E102[Event 102]</pre><p>当事件数量过多时，定期创建快照避免重放全部历史事件。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cqrs-命令查询责任分离\">CQRS（命令查询责任分离）</h2><p>CQRS 将读模型和写模型分离，各自优化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[Command] --&gt; WS[写模型&lt;br/&gt;Event Store]&#10;  WS --&gt;|发布事件| EB[Event Bus]&#10;  EB --&gt; RS[读模型&lt;br/&gt;View Store]&#10;  Q[Query] --&gt; RS\">graph TD\n  C[Command] --&gt; WS[写模型&lt;br/&gt;Event Store]\n  WS --&gt;|发布事件| EB[Event Bus]\n  EB --&gt; RS[读模型&lt;br/&gt;View Store]\n  Q[Query] --&gt; RS</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方面</th>\n<th>写模型</th>\n<th>读模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据存储</td>\n<td>Event Store / 关系数据库</td>\n<td>搜索引擎 / 物化视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化方向</td>\n<td>写入性能、一致性</td>\n<td>查询性能、灵活聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据结构</td>\n<td>规范化</td>\n<td>反规范化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新方式</td>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n<td>异步投影</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"cqrs-事件溯源\">CQRS + 事件溯源</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class OrderAggregate:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.events = []&#10;        self.status = None&#10;        self.items = []&#10;&#10;    def create(self, order_id, user_id, items):&#10;        event = OrderCreated(order_id, user_id, items)&#10;        self._apply(event)&#10;        self.events.append(event)&#10;&#10;    def _apply(self, event):&#10;        if isinstance(event, OrderCreated):&#10;            self.status = &quot;created&quot;&#10;            self.items = event.items&#10;        elif isinstance(event, OrderPaid):&#10;            self.status = &quot;paid&quot;&#10;&#10;class OrderReadModel:&#10;    def __init__(self, db):&#10;        self.db = db&#10;&#10;    def on_order_created(self, event):&#10;        self.db.insert(&quot;order_views&quot;, {&#10;            &quot;order_id&quot;: event.order_id,&#10;            &quot;user_id&quot;: event.user_id,&#10;            &quot;status&quot;: &quot;created&quot;,&#10;            &quot;item_count&quot;: len(event.items),&#10;        })\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderAggregate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, order_id, user_id, items):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrderCreated(order_id, user_id, items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._apply(event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.events.append(event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _apply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, event):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isinstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event, OrderCreated):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"created\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.items</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        elif</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isinstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event, OrderPaid):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"paid\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderReadModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, db):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.db </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> on_order_created</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, event):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.db.insert(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_views\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: event.order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: event.user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"item_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.items),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件总线模式\">事件总线模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>代表技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消息代理</td>\n<td>中心化 Broker 转发事件</td>\n<td>Kafka、RabbitMQ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件网格</td>\n<td>分布式事件路由</td>\n<td>EventGrid、Knative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件存储</td>\n<td>专用事件持久化存储</td>\n<td>EventStoreDB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"outbox-模式\">Outbox 模式</h2><p>解决数据库更新和事件发布的原子性问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant S as Service&#10;  participant DB as Database&#10;  participant R as Relay&#10;  participant MQ as Message Queue&#10;&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT order&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT outbox_event&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;DB: COMMIT&#10;  R-&gt;&gt;DB: POLL outbox_event&#10;  R-&gt;&gt;MQ: PUBLISH event&#10;  R-&gt;&gt;DB: MARK event as published\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant S as Service\n  participant DB as Database\n  participant R as Relay\n  participant MQ as Message Queue\n\n  S-&gt;&gt;DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION\n  S-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT order\n  S-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT outbox_event\n  S-&gt;&gt;DB: COMMIT\n  R-&gt;&gt;DB: POLL outbox_event\n  R-&gt;&gt;MQ: PUBLISH event\n  R-&gt;&gt;DB: MARK event as published</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>事件应该是不可变的事实描述，而非命令</li>\n<li>使用 CloudEvents 规范统一事件格式</li>\n<li>事件溯源场景使用快照避免重放性能问题（如每 100 个事件一个快照）</li>\n<li>CQRS 不必与事件溯源绑定——可以独立使用</li>\n<li>使用 Outbox 模式保证数据库变更和事件发布的一致性</li>\n<li>为每个事件分配唯一 ID，消费端实现幂等处理</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>事件驱动架构用发布/订阅取代直接 RPC，换来了松耦合与高扩展——新增订阅者无需改动发布方，代价是系统从同步强一致转为最终一致。它的三个常用配套模式各司其职：事件溯源把状态变更存为不可变事件序列以获得完整历史，CQRS 分离读写模型各自优化，Outbox 用同库事务内的事件表加独立 Relay 保证数据库变更与事件发布的原子性。落地时的基本纪律是：事件描述事实而非命令、统一格式（如 CloudEvents）、为事件分配唯一 ID 并在消费端做幂等。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"事件驱动架构","id":"事件驱动架构"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"事件驱动 vs 请求驱动","id":"事件驱动-vs-请求驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"事件类型","id":"事件类型"},{"level":3,"text":"事件结构","id":"事件结构"},{"level":2,"text":"事件溯源（Event Sourcing）","id":"事件溯源-event-sourcing"},{"level":3,"text":"传统 CRUD vs 事件溯源","id":"传统-crud-vs-事件溯源"},{"level":3,"text":"快照优化","id":"快照优化"},{"level":2,"text":"CQRS（命令查询责任分离）","id":"cqrs-命令查询责任分离"},{"level":3,"text":"CQRS + 事件溯源","id":"cqrs-事件溯源"},{"level":2,"text":"事件总线模式","id":"事件总线模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Outbox 模式","id":"outbox-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Kafka 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/kafka-deep-dive"},"next":{"title":"流处理框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/stream-processing"}}